    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="First Galactic Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d2">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">Hari Seldon was the last great scientist of the First Empire.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="psycho-history" id="0">
      <data key="d2">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">It was he who brought the science of psycho-history to its full development.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="Empire in decay" id="0">
      <data key="d2">FORESAW</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">It was Seldon, then, who foresaw, against all common sense and popular belief, that the brilliant Empire which seemed so strong was in a state of irremediable decay and decline.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="First Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d2">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
