    <edge source="Mule" target="Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">When the Foundation fell to the Mule without a fight</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mule" target="Foundation" id="1">
      <data key="d2">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.8</data>
      <data key="d4">He might have established his capital on the Foundation, the strongest of his now-conquered enemies, but it was far out on the very rim of the Galaxy.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mule" target="Captain Pritcher" id="0">
      <data key="d2">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
