    <edge source="First Galactic Empire" target="Galaxy" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">The First Galactic Empire had endured for tens of thousands of years. It had included all the planets of the Galaxy in a centralized rule, sometimes tyrannical, sometimes benevolent, always orderly.</data>
    </edge>
