    </edge>
    <edge source="psychohistory" target="Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d2">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">It was that psychohistory which Seldon and the group he worked with applied in full force to the establishment of the Foundation.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Ducem Barr" id="0">
      <data key="d2">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">Bel Riose smiled at the old man. “I am Riose-”  “I recognize you.”</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Galactic Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d2">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">I like to fight.  “That’s why they sent me here. I’m too troublesome at court.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Twentieth Fleet" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">the idolized lion of the Twentieth Fleet</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d2">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">he faced the Foundation squarely</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Foundation" id="1">
      <data key="d2">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">Empire versus Foundation, that it?” “Right.”</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Padishah Emperor" id="0">
      <data key="d2">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">Patrician, are you a loyal subject of the Emperor?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Fleet" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">Commander Yume has reported that the Fleet is ready for an immediate attack in retaliation.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Cleon II" id="0">
      <data key="d2">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
