      <data key="d2">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">He began his career as a cadet in the Guards ten years back</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="affair off the Lemul Cluster" id="0">
      <data key="d2">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">He had part in that affair off the Lemul Cluster</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="his men" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">His men, I understand, are completely under his control</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="expedition in force" id="0">
      <data key="d2">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">He has spied out the land of these barbarians and advocates an expedition in force</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="forces of the Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">the report went back to Bel Riose at the General Headquarters he had established on the rocky barrenness of a wandering sunless planet.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="war" id="0">
      <data key="d2">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">Empire versus Foundation, that it?” “Right.”</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Wanda" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">his walk through the gardens of the obscure planet Wanda, now temporary Imperial headquarters</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Siwennian" id="0">
      <data key="d2">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.8</data>
      <data key="d4">In the meanwhile, what of this other man you just mentioned, this Siwennian? You keep too many enemies in your good graces.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Siwennian" id="1">
      <data key="d2">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.7</data>
      <data key="d4">But he is a Siwennian and the son of a proscribed rebel.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="Enclosure" id="0">
      <data key="d2">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.8</data>
      <data key="d4">Interesting in that the Enclosure is complete today.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bel Riose" target="army" id="0">
      <data key="d2">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">But Riose is not just a villain, doc. He’s the whole blamed army. It would fall apart without him.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ducem Barr" target="Imperial rule" id="0">
      <data key="d2">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">I have no cause to love Imperial rule.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ducem Barr" target="Onum Barr" id="0">
      <data key="d2">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">But just the same I’d like to have you prove that you’re the son of Onum Barr of Siwenna - the sixth and youngest who escaped the massacre.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Onum Barr" target="Ducem Barr" id="0">
      <data key="d2">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">My father was a Patrician of the Empire and a Senator of Siwenna. His name was Onum Barr.</data>
    </edge>
