      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
      <data key="d4">Kalgan, more centrally located, with a long tradition as aristocracy’s playground</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Channis" target="Second Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d2">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d3">0.7</data>
      <data key="d4">Channis was improvising words to the tune he was humming. Nonsense words with the recurrent refrain: “Second Foundation threatens the Nation and all of Creation.”</data>
    </edge>
